{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Vampire's Best Friend",
    "steam_appid": 3583530,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><u>Fly Through the Night</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583530/extras/fac3ffd9c787a20de0744538a18d6073.avif?t=1748459945\" width=608 height=192 /></span>We've all had that dream where you're flying in the sky only to wake up to your boring terrestrial life, but dream no more! Fly around as a bat with unique movement that re-contextualizes precision platformer trappings and flips them upside-down! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u> </u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Old-School Charm</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583530/extras/957ea22cb14c07a8e733a46bb94ef5a9.avif?t=1748459945\" width=608 height=192 /></span>Limitations were imposed on the palette, sprite size, and audio fidelity to really deliver on that old-school feeling. Retaining the difficulty of retro games, but with modern design sensibilities so you wont be throwing your rectangular controller. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Open World</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583530/extras/83b2ad497022a6ddfb9e93bb04cb2bd7.avif?t=1748459945\" width=608 height=192 /></span><br>it's tough out there, but you can take it at your own pace. If you're ever stuck on a challenge, you can easily take a different path and find another way forward.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Carve Your Own Path</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583530/extras/8bedf279b34d956cfe1a9a553fada600.avif?t=1748459945\" width=608 height=192 /></span>There are plenty of routes you can take through the game, but there's gotta be one that's the best, right? The world is designed to let players experiment with routing and find the fastest, or easiest, way through the game, depending on if you're hardcore or looking for something more chill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><u>Fly Through the Night</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583530/extras/fac3ffd9c787a20de0744538a18d6073.avif?t=1748459945\" width=608 height=192 /></span>We've all had that dream where you're flying in the sky only to wake up to your boring terrestrial life, but dream no more! Fly around as a bat with unique movement that re-contextualizes precision platformer trappings and flips them upside-down! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u> </u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Old-School Charm</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583530/extras/957ea22cb14c07a8e733a46bb94ef5a9.avif?t=1748459945\" width=608 height=192 /></span>Limitations were imposed on the palette, sprite size, and audio fidelity to really deliver on that old-school feeling. Retaining the difficulty of retro games, but with modern design sensibilities so you wont be throwing your rectangular controller. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Open World</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583530/extras/83b2ad497022a6ddfb9e93bb04cb2bd7.avif?t=1748459945\" width=608 height=192 /></span><br>it's tough out there, but you can take it at your own pace. If you're ever stuck on a challenge, you can easily take a different path and find another way forward.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Carve Your Own Path</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583530/extras/8bedf279b34d956cfe1a9a553fada600.avif?t=1748459945\" width=608 height=192 /></span>There are plenty of routes you can take through the game, but there's gotta be one that's the best, right? The world is designed to let players experiment with routing and find the fastest, or easiest, way through the game, depending on if you're hardcore or looking for something more chill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Vampire hunters are after a mischievous vampire girl, and it's up to her pet bat to save the day. Flap through peril in this open-ended precision \u201cbatformer\u201d with a unique control scheme that re-contextualizes precision platformer trappings and flips them upside-down!",
